WEBVTT

01:38.660 --> 01:40.120
AIYEAGGH...

01:40.780 --> 01:42.740
Who sent you, asshole?

01:43.870 --> 01:45.500
I'll tell you everything you want to know!

01:45.500 --> 01:47.420
It was Yoroshisa—

01:47.420 --> 01:49.130
EEYAAAGGGH!

01:50.750 --> 01:52.210
Who the hell are you, asshole?

01:59.550 --> 02:00.800
DŌMO.

02:00.800 --> 02:02.890
I am LOBSTER.

02:00.800 --> 02:02.890
NOTE: LOBSTERS are large marine crustaceans.

02:02.890 --> 02:04.890
Screw you, asshole!

02:07.020 --> 02:09.020
This is bad news.

02:14.690 --> 02:15.740
YEEART!

02:17.490 --> 02:18.780
AIYEAGGH!

02:18.780 --> 02:20.370
SO HOT!

02:20.990 --> 02:22.910
AIYEAGGH!

02:22.910 --> 02:25.410
Who sent you, asshole?!

02:26.080 --> 02:27.790
AIYEAGGH!

02:27.790 --> 02:30.630
You're going to pay for this, asshole!

02:36.210 --> 02:37.470
Fool.

02:37.720 --> 02:41.010
You've killed far too many times without considering your target.

02:41.010 --> 02:43.890
You've upset my SPONSOR-SAMA.

02:43.890 --> 02:47.060
The ones who sent me were Yoroshisa—

02:47.810 --> 02:50.850
GWAAARGH!

02:58.320 --> 03:00.150
DŌMO, LOBSTER-SAN.

03:00.950 --> 03:03.280
I am NINJA Slayer.

03:08.450 --> 03:11.210
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

03:11.210 --> 03:12.790
I am LOBSTER.

03:12.790 --> 03:15.290
NINJAS must be slain!

03:15.550 --> 03:20.430
But why are you here,
NINJA Slayer-SAN?

03:20.430 --> 03:21.470
YEEART!

03:22.140 --> 03:23.720
GWAAARGH!

03:26.970 --> 03:29.520
This can't be! It just can't...

03:29.520 --> 03:30.770
GWAAARGH!

03:30.770 --> 03:33.100
SAYŌNARA!

03:45.780 --> 03:48.540
You saved me, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

03:48.540 --> 03:50.910
But, I'm sorry.

03:50.910 --> 03:52.170
Once again...

04:13.190 --> 04:14.600
This is the end.

04:14.900 --> 04:17.650
Fuyuko! Tochinoki!

04:17.650 --> 04:19.320
YEEART!

04:20.740 --> 04:22.450
GWAAARGH!

04:22.450 --> 04:23.700
YEEART!

04:23.700 --> 04:24.360
I...

04:24.360 --> 04:25.030
have...

04:25.030 --> 04:25.660
been...

04:25.950 --> 04:28.410
beaten...

04:55.350 --> 04:58.610
Baby, grow up. Baby.

06:13.510 --> 06:16.480
DŌMO, Dark NINJA-SAN.

06:16.480 --> 06:18.690
I am Master TORTOISE.

06:20.690 --> 06:23.570
DŌMO, Master TORTOISE-SAN.

06:23.820 --> 06:25.320
I am Dark NINJA.

06:25.820 --> 06:29.820
I'm glad you're all right, Dark NINJA-SAN.

06:29.820 --> 06:32.280
I was afraid I'd wasted my time.

06:36.870 --> 06:38.290
This is BEPPIN.

06:38.830 --> 06:43.210
I recovered the blade and hilt from the scene of the battle.

06:43.210 --> 06:45.590
These belong to you.

06:50.090 --> 06:51.970
Am I going to die here?

06:53.010 --> 06:55.640
The hour of your death has not yet come.

06:56.680 --> 07:00.440
A great destiny protects you.

07:03.310 --> 07:05.610
You're the one whose voice I heard that day?

07:06.320 --> 07:10.700
Seek out Thunder FORGE-SAN, Dark NINJA-SAN.

07:11.070 --> 07:14.410
He is capable of reforging BEPPIN.

07:14.700 --> 07:17.790
Your typical KATANA blacksmith won't cut it.

07:17.790 --> 07:20.620
For disaster is soon to be upon you.

07:21.580 --> 07:23.830
Thunder FORGE.

07:23.830 --> 07:26.170
I've never heard of a KATANA blacksmith by that name.

07:26.750 --> 07:28.710
You will know him soon.

07:28.710 --> 07:31.590
I'll be on my way. FAREWELL!

07:36.180 --> 07:40.060
Be careful with fire! Be careful with fire!

07:57.540 --> 08:00.200
The greatest of my bio-technologies...

08:05.920 --> 08:07.590
It's moving?

08:07.590 --> 08:10.590
The bio-structures are still alive?

08:14.390 --> 08:17.220
Curse you, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

08:20.310 --> 08:22.520
I swear upon this claw!

08:22.520 --> 08:25.060
I shall make a...

08:28.860 --> 08:31.240
I shall make a second LOB...

08:35.450 --> 08:39.620
That I shall make a second LOBSTER-SAN...

08:40.620 --> 08:42.000
A second LOBSTER-SAN...

08:42.000 --> 08:45.960
and have my revenge upon you!

08:59.720 --> 09:02.350
I love the sound of your voice when you cry.

09:02.350 --> 09:05.440
Now come quickly, NINJA Slayer-SAN,

09:05.440 --> 09:09.400
or this VOLUPTUOUS hacker will be boiled alive!

09:18.620 --> 09:20.410
WASSHOI!

09:20.790 --> 09:23.160
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

09:23.160 --> 09:24.790
I am LOBSTER.

09:25.410 --> 09:27.830
DŌMO. I am NINJA Slayer.

09:28.330 --> 09:31.050
Did you regenerate? But that's impossible!

09:31.050 --> 09:33.090
I did indeed!

09:33.090 --> 09:35.930
The CLONE YAKUZA shall fight you!

09:37.090 --> 09:39.140
Screw you, asshole!

09:39.140 --> 09:41.970
If you resist, I will cut this chain!

09:47.770 --> 09:49.360
Take this, fucker!

09:50.060 --> 09:50.820
YEEART!

09:50.820 --> 09:52.400
GWAAARGH!

09:53.400 --> 09:58.070
Fool! This woman's death is upon your head!

09:59.740 --> 10:00.660
YEEART!

10:06.620 --> 10:10.330
Curse you, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

10:11.210 --> 10:12.040
YEEART!

10:14.130 --> 10:16.970
A mere SURIKEN cannot break my CLAW's shell.

10:16.970 --> 10:18.720
Now die!

10:19.140 --> 10:20.300
YEEART!

10:21.350 --> 10:23.180
Impossible! How can he—

10:23.560 --> 10:24.890
YEEART!

10:25.890 --> 10:27.890
UWAAARGHH!

10:29.520 --> 10:30.150
What's this?

10:31.560 --> 10:33.360
Why did you do such a thing?

10:33.690 --> 10:36.940
B-Because I wanted to make you pay,

10:36.940 --> 10:39.160
NINJA Slayer-SAN!

10:39.160 --> 10:43.740
This was the only means of vengeance I had left!

10:43.740 --> 10:44.830
YEEART!

10:44.830 --> 10:46.000
GWAAARGH!

10:46.000 --> 10:50.790
Now Lobster-SAN's power and soul dwell within my arm.

10:46.000 --> 10:50.790
NOTE: See? We didn't just forget.

10:51.170 --> 10:53.750
In a sense, I am a NINJA now.

10:53.960 --> 10:56.550
Now die, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

10:56.550 --> 10:57.590
YEEART!

10:57.590 --> 10:59.340
GWAHH!

11:01.300 --> 11:03.050
EYYYARRGH!

11:04.220 --> 11:05.470
GWAHH!

11:06.180 --> 11:08.100
YEEART!

11:18.940 --> 11:20.610
WASSHOI!

11:23.370 --> 11:25.450
You saved me. Thank you.

11:26.450 --> 11:28.330
Unfortunately, once again...

11:28.330 --> 11:32.080
It was my fault for getting you involved this time.

11:32.500 --> 11:34.790
I should not have done such a half-boiled job.

11:32.500 --> 11:34.790
NOTE: Increase BOILING TIME based on the lobster's SIZE.

11:35.590 --> 11:37.090
You're right.

11:37.090 --> 11:39.630
This may be a saying.

11:40.170 --> 11:43.680
The madness of a man hellbent on revenge

11:43.930 --> 11:46.350
is often more terrifying than a NINJA.

11:47.310 --> 11:49.180
I shall carve that upon my kidneys.
